    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in the heart of Kilkenny City, this superb two-bedroom apartment on Barrack Street presents an outstanding opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike. Perfectly positioned within walking distance of the city centre, the property combines modern urban living with excellent convenience, surrounded by a wealth of amenities and services.\n\nThe accommodation is both bright and well-proportioned throughout. It comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious open-plan kitchen/living area filled with natural light, two generously sized bedrooms, and two well-appointed bathroom facilities. The open-plan living space provides an ideal setting for both everyday comfort and entertaining, while the bedrooms offer excellent proportions and a calm, comfortable retreat.\n\nBarrack Street is one of Kilkenny's most established and convenient residential locations, placing residents just minutes from the vibrant city centre. A superb selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops, and supermarkets are all within easy reach, while MacDonagh Junction Shopping Centre and Market Cross Shopping Centre provide extensive retail options nearby. The city's historic medieval quarter is also just a short stroll away, offering culture, heritage, and leisure on your doorstep.\n\nConnectivity is excellent, with Kilkenny Train Station located only a short distance away, providing regular services to Dublin, Waterford, and beyond. A strong local bus network serves the surrounding areas, while the nearby M9 motorway offers swift and convenient access to Carlow, Waterford, Dublin, and surrounding counties, making this an ideal base for commuters.\n\nThe area is also well served by a range of educational facilities, all within easy reach, alongside nearby healthcare services, leisure amenities, and scenic riverside walks that further enhance the lifestyle appeal of this highly desirable location.\n\nBlending comfort, convenience, and city-centre living, this attractive apartment represents a rare opportunity to secure a well-positioned home in one of Kilkenny's most sought-after residential settings.\n\nAcommodation\n\nEntrance Hall - A welcoming, spacious entryway featuring durable laminate wooden flooring.\n\nLiving Area - A bright living space finished with cohesive laminate wooden flooring, designed for comfort and ease of maintenance.\n\nKitchen - A functional open-plan space with tiled flooring. Equipped with a comprehensive range of over-and-under-counter cabinetry and fully integrated appliances.\n\nDining Area - Flowing seamlessly from the kitchen, this area features laminate wooden flooring and is anchored by an electric fireplace, creating a cozy focal point for meals.\n\nBedroom 1 - A generous double bedroom featuring soft carpet flooring and integrated built-in wardrobes for ample storage.\n\nEn-suite - This space is partially tiled from floor to ceiling and includes a dedicated shower unit and white sanitary ware.\n\nBedroom 2 - A second well-sized double bedroom, also fitted with carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - Fully tiled flooring comprising a full bath with shower over-head, and a classic white suite (WC and wash hand basin)."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
